# detail
Number of changes: 1

1. Added | Loop statement
   Added a loop over `named_by.items()` that type-checks each `value` and, when the type is invalid, constructs an error message and raises `TypeError`.
   This includes:

   * Conditional statement: test whether `value` is not a `str`, `pl.Expr`, or `pl.Series`;
   * Assignment statement: assign a multiline error message to `msg`;
   * Exception statement: execute `raise TypeError(msg)`.
# /detail
